10
00:00:29.610 --> 00:00:33.400
KDV Website Services builds the system
your business runs on.

11
00:00:33.550 --> 00:00:36.000
A website that brings customers to you.

12
00:00:36.050 --> 00:00:39.400
A dashboard that shows today's sales, any time.

13
00:00:39.450 --> 00:00:43.150
And custom web apps, built around
how your team already works.

14
00:00:43.550 --> 00:00:46.250
So you see the whole business without asking anyone...

15
00:00:46.300 --> 00:00:47.810
